[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0496","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0496.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0645","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD REST命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 版本在处理 RESTART (REST) 命令时存在输入验证缺陷，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过 STOU、STOR 或 APPE 等命令向文件末尾之外写入数据或向不存在的文件写入内容，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 WFTPD 2.41 及更早版本，攻击者只需网络可达即可触发，无需任何权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0645"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10Z","remediation":"升级 WFTPD 至 2.42 或更高版本，该版本已修复 REST 命令越界写入问题。如无法升级，在 FTP 服务器配置中禁用 STOU/STOR/APPE 命令的写入权限，或限制可写目录的访问范围。若 WFTPD 已停止维护，建议迁移至 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd 等仍在维护的 FTP 服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20101","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0645.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0645","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0645.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0645.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-24r6-29j2-hrjv/GHSA-24r6-29j2-hrjv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0645.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e3ebd4ef-ac1a-4303-bfd4-e428085b5411.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0645.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0496.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0495","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0495.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0644","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD STAT/LIST 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD 2.4.1 及 WFTPD Pro 2.41 存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，通过在 LIST 命令仍在执行时发送特制的 STAT 命令，导致 FTP 服务进程崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需任何权限，仅影响系统可用性。公开的 PoC 代码已在 ExploitDB 发布，可被直接用于攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0644"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-21T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:10Z","remediation":"升级至 WFTPD 2.4.1 RC11 或更高版本可修复此漏洞。由于 WFTPD 已长期停止维护，建议迁移至 FileZilla Server 或 vsftpd 等仍在更新的 FTP 服务器软件。临时缓解措施：在防火墙上限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 FTP 端口 21，并禁用匿名用户执行 STAT 命令的权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0295.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1477","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1506","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5003","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20100","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0644.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0644","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0644.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0644.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c4qc-qrx8-9prp/GHSA-c4qc-qrx8-9prp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0644.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0644.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d23c5bcf-bd8e-4bd8-bb92-e476ce438a4c.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0495.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1400","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0621","title":"Microsoft Outlook和Outlook Express缓存Bypass文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 98/2000 及 Outlook Express 4.0x/5.0x 存在缓存绕过漏洞（Cache Bypass）。远程攻击者可构造特制的畸形 HTML 邮件，利用邮件客户端对 HTML 内容中文件缓存机制的缺陷，将恶意文件存储到缓存目录之外的位置，从而读取客户端系统上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露。Microsoft 已在后续安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0621"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"立即安装 Internet Explorer 5.01 Service Pack 1 或 Internet Explorer 5.5，您将获得不受影响的 Outlook Express 5.5 版本，修复了此缓存 bypass 漏洞。或者，将 Microsoft Outlook 升级到包含补丁的 Office 2000 版本。Office 2000 更新可由 Microsoft Product Support 获取。也可以直接应用微软知识库文章 Q247638 补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-14.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1501","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-046","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5013","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0621.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0621.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0621","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0621.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0621.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vvh2-vwv7-8grx/GHSA-vvh2-vwv7-8grx.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0621.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0621.md","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1400.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0825","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0825.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0672","title":"Apache Tomcat 管理控制台任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Jakarta Tomcat 3.1 默认配置中未对 /admin 管理控制台进行访问限制，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可直接调用管理 Servlet，通过添加根目录上下文（Context）实现任意文件读取。该漏洞可导致敏感配置文件、源代码等机密信息泄露，影响 Tomcat 3.1 及更早版本。攻击者只需网络可达目标服务器的 8080 端口即可利用，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0672"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:14Z","remediation":"升级 Jakarta Tomcat 至 3.2 及以上版本，该版本默认限制 /admin 上下文访问。如无法升级，编辑 server.xml 移除 <Context path=\"/admin\" .../> 配置项，或在 web.xml 中为 /admin 路径添加 IP 访问限制（<security-constraint>），仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问。同时删除 $CATALINA_HOME/webapps/admin 目录以彻底移除管理控制台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0309.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1548","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5160","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0672.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/93bf7691fc17bf58197ad166ee362b4808566d7c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0672.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2000/CVE-2000-0672.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0672.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0672","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0672.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0672.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0672.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ede54228d8182d817ef6ee6ad5a3cbc931b4a7cd/2000/CVE-2000-0672.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3e38e95f2e1dd1607b843a3c921eb524d7c4f47f/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-06xx/CVE-2000-0672.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0825.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0825.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0825.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0505","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0505.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0653","title":"Microsoft Outlook Express 持续邮件浏览器链接信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook Express 存在持久邮件浏览器链接漏洞（Persistent Mail-Browser Link），远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制电子邮件，利用 JavaScript 在用户浏览器中创建与 Outlook Express 窗口的持久链接，从而监控用户的邮件阅读活动。该漏洞影响 Outlook Express 5 及之前版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击，可能导致用户隐私泄露。目前已有公开的利用代码（ExploitDB ID: 19738），建议用户升级至更高版本或禁用脚本执行功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0653"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:11Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Outlook Express 5.5（可通过默认安装 Internet Explorer 5.01 Service Pack 1 或 Internet Explorer 5.5 获得），或安装 MS00-045 安全补丁。如无法升级，可采取以下缓解措施：在 Outlook Express 中禁用预览窗格（查看→布局→取消勾选\"显示预览窗格\"）；将 HTML 邮件分配到受限站点区域，并在该区域禁用 Active Scripting（Internet Explorer→工具→Internet 选项→安全→受限站点→自定义级别→脚本→Active Scripting→禁用）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1502","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-045","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19738","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0653.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0653.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0653","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9d5b2a1dce9c7e458934cecfd52fe64aaa62e247/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0653.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0653.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5jwc-8539-rgx6/GHSA-5jwc-8539-rgx6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0653.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/da07cb97146d03883b70ca493bde18a430b683ac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0653.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0505.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0505.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0505.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0481","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0481.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0624","title":"NullSoft Winamp 2.64 .m3u 播放列表缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NullSoft Winamp 2.64 及更早版本在处理 M3U 播放列表文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含超长 #EXTINF: 扩展字段的恶意 .m3u 文件，诱使用户在 Winamp 中打开该文件，触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，影响所有使用 Winamp 2.64 及之前版本的用户。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0624"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"升级 Winamp 至 2.65 或更高版本，该版本已修复 M3U 播放列表解析中的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法升级，避免打开来源不明的 .m3u 文件，并考虑使用其他播放器作为替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0289.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1496","http://www.winamp.com/getwinamp/newfeatures.jhtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4956","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20094","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0624.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0624","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0624.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0624.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m85g-37m6-fpww/GHSA-m85g-37m6-fpww.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0624.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0624.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2c1c1db6-4f49-492d-b096-ed972bb5c981.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0481.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0745","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0745.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0619","title":"Top Layer AppSwitch 2500 ICMP报文处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Top Layer AppSwitch 2500 存在 ICMP 数据包处理缺陷，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络向目标设备发送特制的畸形 ICMP 数据包，触发设备协议栈解析异常，导致设备拒绝服务，无法正常转发网络流量。该漏洞影响 Top Layer AppSwitch 2500 系列产品，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前厂商已发布相关修复建议。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0619"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"Top Layer AppSwitch 2500 已停止技术支持且不再发布固件更新，建议将设备替换为受支持的现代应用交付控制器（ADC）。在完成替换前，可在边界防火墙上配置规则丢弃（drop）所有入站 ICMP 报文（包括 Echo Request、Timestamp、Address Mask 等类型），并限制 ICMP 速率以缓解畸形报文导致的拒绝服务攻击。同时建议将设备管理接口隔离到独立管理 VLAN，避免暴露在不可信网络中。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/0680.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2000-q2/0921.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1258","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7364","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0619.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0619","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0619.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0619.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xfmh-wgwr-479f/GHSA-xfmh-wgwr-479f.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0619.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0619.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2473a005-538a-403f-902e-87fb8b51d47f.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0745.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0739","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0739.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0615","title":"LPRng lpd 本地信息泄露漏洞","description":"LPRng 3.6.x 版本中 lpd 守护进程被错误地设置为 setuid root 权限，导致本地用户可利用该配置缺陷向 lpd 的跟踪和日志文件中追加任意内容。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限，通过精心构造的日志追加操作可能干扰系统正常日志记录或掩盖恶意行为痕迹。该漏洞影响 LPRng 3.6.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，建议升级至不受影响的版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0615"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:06Z","remediation":"立即移除 lpd 二进制文件的 setuid root 权限：执行 `chmod u-s $(which lpd)` 取消 SUID 位，防止本地用户以 root 权限追加日志。升级 LPRng 至 3.7 及以上版本，该版本已修复默认以 setuid root 安装的问题。如无法升级，通过文件权限控制限制 lpd 仅允许 lp 组用户执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0117.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1447","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7361","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0615.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0615","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0615.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0615.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xq2m-9f8c-rr6w/GHSA-xq2m-9f8c-rr6w.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0615.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--877fce88-883a-4021-ad46-943c76441b12.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0615.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0739.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0486","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0486.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0636","title":"HP JetDirect FTP 服务拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP JetDirect 打印服务器 FTP 服务在处理畸形 FTP quote 命令时存在输入验证缺陷，远程未授权攻击者可向目标 FTP 端口发送畸形命令导致服务崩溃拒绝服务。影响 HP JetDirect 打印服务器固件版本 G.08.20、H.08.20 及更早版本，CVSS 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击者无需认证即可通过网络发送恶意 FTP 命令触发拒绝服务。HP 已发布固件更新修复该漏洞，建议升级至 H.08.21 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0636"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09Z","remediation":"将 HP JetDirect 固件升级到高于 G.08.20 / H.08.20 的版本以修复畸形 FTP quote 命令导致的拒绝服务；若无法立即升级，在打印机管理界面或 telnet/Web 配置中关闭 JetDirect FTP 服务，并在防火墙/ACL 上阻断对打印机 TCP 21 端口的入站访问，必要时对受影响设备断电重启以恢复服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0265.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1491","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4947","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20090","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/145038fbd12ba507a810d82f3ca7bed9554ecf9f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0636.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0636","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0636.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68711f4b9de04c730603adbbe0fe7b126b6784b4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0636.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/effb2f348554323580d029ec0e691334888b7fed/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j5xj-256c-jv3v/GHSA-j5xj-256c-jv3v.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0636.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f6c76f78-6128-4ca7-b68c-4a69a54ba171.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0486.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0479","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0479.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0622","title":"O'Reilly WebSite Professional webfind.exe 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"O'Reilly WebSite Professional Web 服务器 2.x 版本中的 webfind.cgi 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长 keywords 参数的恶意 URL 触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区溢出，从而在服务器上以 Web 进程权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 WebSite Professional 2.3.18/2.4/2.4.9 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，已有公开的 Exploit-DB 利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0622"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07Z","remediation":"O'Reilly WebSite Professional 已于 2000 年代停止维护，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS）。如因遗留系统无法迁移，应删除或禁用 webfind.exe CGI 程序（通常位于 cgi-bin 目录），并在 Web 服务器或网络防火墙层面限制对 webfind.exe 的访问，仅允许可信 IP 调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://website.oreilly.com/support/software/wspro25_releasenotes.txt","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/043.asp","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1487","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4962","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20086","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0622.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0622.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0622","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2000/CVE-2000-0622/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0622.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/webfind.nasl","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0622.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c9gg-qqjg-6v7f/GHSA-c9gg-qqjg-6v7f.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0622.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0479.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0771","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0771.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0633","title":"Mandrake Linux usermode 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mandrake Linux 的 usermode 用户模式数据包存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者利用该漏洞可导致系统重启或关机，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 usermode 包对用户权限检查不严，允许无特权的本地用户执行本应仅限 root 用户操作的重启或关机命令。攻击者只需拥有本地 shell 访问权限即可触发，无需身份认证，但无法远程利用。该漏洞影响 Mandrake Linux 多个版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0633"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09Z","remediation":"升级 usermode 包至修复版本（Mandrake Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-2000-053 公告提供的更新包），或从受影响系统中移除 usermode 包的 suid 权限位：执行 chmod u-s /usr/bin/reboot /usr/bin/halt 移除不必要的 setuid 权限，限制可执行关机命令的用户组。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0251.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0117.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-053.html