，窃取敏感信息或进一步横向移动，造成严重的权限管理风险。漏洞 CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0627"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 BlackBoard CourseInfo 至 4.0.1 或更高版本（已修复 CGI 认证绕过漏洞），或在 Web 服务器层面通过 .htaccess 或 web.config 限制 user_update_passwd.pl、user_update_admin.pl 等 CGI 脚本仅允许授权 IP 访问，同时在应用层添加严格的用户身份验证与权限校验，临时缓解可禁用相关 CGI 脚本执行权限。立即联系 BlackBoard（现 Anthology）获取官方补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0254.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1486","http://www.securityfocus.com/frames/?content=/templates/archive.pike%3Flist%3D1%26msg%3D20000719151904.I17986%40securityfocus.com","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4946","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0627.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0627","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0627.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0627.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w2fq-mj73-7568/GHSA-w2fq-mj73-7568.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0627.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0627.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0757.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0757.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0757.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0751","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0751.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0625","title":"NetZero ZeroPort 3.0 用户登录信息弱加密存储漏洞","description":"NetZero ZeroPort 3.0 及更早版本使用弱加密方法存储用户登录凭据，本地攻击者可利用该漏洞解密存储的密码信息。该漏洞源于软件对用户凭证的加密强度不足，采用可逆或易破解的加密算法，导致具有本地系统访问权限的攻击者能够获取明文密码。攻击者一旦成功解密，可进一步利用获取的凭证进行横向移动或权限提升。该漏洞影响 NetZero ZeroPort 3.0 及所有更早版本，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。建议用户升级到修复此漏洞的更新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0625"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"立即升级 NetZero ZeroPort 至 3.0 以上版本（如 3.1 或更高），该版本已改用强加密算法存储用户登录凭据。由于 NetZero 拨号服务已停止运营，建议彻底卸载 NetZero ZeroPort 软件，改用其他现代宽带 ISP 客户端，避免本地弱加密密码泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.l0pht.com/advisories/netzero.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1483","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2000/CVE-2000-0625.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0625.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0625","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0625.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0625.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rpxp-9755-926w/GHSA-rpxp-9755-926w.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0625.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1483/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152600_152700.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0751.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0482","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0482.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0626","title":"Computer Software Manufaktur Alibaba 2.0 Web服务器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Alibaba Web Server 2.0（Computer Software Manufaktur 产品）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送超长 GET 请求触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响 Alibaba 2.0 版本。Exploit-DB 上已有公开的拒绝服务利用代码（EDB-ID: 20080）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0626"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:08Z","remediation":"立即停止使用已停止维护的 Alibaba 2.0 Web 服务器，迁移至 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 或 IIS 等仍在安全更新的现代 Web 服务器。如短期内无法迁移，可在网络边界防火墙或 WAF 上配置规则，拦截长度超过 8000 字节的 HTTP GET 请求，并限制仅允许可信 IP 访问该服务以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0237.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1482","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20080","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0626.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0626","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0626.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0626.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7j9c-jj55-7hhm/GHSA-7j9c-jj55-7hhm.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/alibaba_overflow.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0626.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1482/info.html","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0482.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0450","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0450.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0567","title":"Microsoft Outlook / Outlook Express 邮件头Date字段缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Microsoft Outlook 97/98/2000 及 Outlook Express 4.0/5.0 的邮件头解析组件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 Date 字段的恶意邮件触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者可在邮件中嵌入精心构造的 Date 头数据，当 Outlook 或 Outlook Express 解析畸形邮件头时触发栈溢出，从而控制受影响系统。该漏洞无需用户交互，仅需打开或预览邮件即可触发，危害较大。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0567"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-07-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-043 提供的补丁，或执行 Internet Explorer 5.01 Service Pack 1 的默认安装以更新 Inetcomm.dll 组件。Windows 2000 用户如已安装 IE 5.5，可安装 MS00-043 补丁或降级至 IE 5.01 SP1。Outlook 用户若仅使用 MAPI 协议风险较低，但仍建议安装补丁以防范其他关联漏洞（MS00-045/MS00-046）。如无法立即打补丁，可将 Outlook 切换为仅使用 MAPI 协议作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1481","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-043","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4953","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20079","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2000/CVE-2000-0567.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4a22bba3217932039300edbc77cd188c415d71c8/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0567.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0567","https://github.com/xaitax/SploitScan/blob/938d5f69569a096cf728175efd0ca15f6fd92c6a/README.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7418aa4f1c4590a239ce7ccd2c9efba72e268cc5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0567.json","https://github.com/biggerwing/nsfocus-rsas-knowledge-base/blob/156208b301d4649ead13cd15f827830d08245b89/example","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0567.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/29919db3f954d9ce9be0e7e3cf177436392d45d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4w6m-4639-4jgr/GHSA-4w6m-4639-4jgr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0567.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0450.toml"}]